{"id":500,"education_philosophy":null,"history":null,"facilities":null,"feature_summary":"カトリック精神で愛の人を育てる","feature_description":"福山暁の星女子中学・高等学校は、カトリックのミッションスクールとして『愛の人』を育てることをめざしています。中高コース制や教育の特色、海外留学・海外研修など、学びと体験をつなぐ導線がはっきりしています。クラブ活動も『共に高め合い心と身体を磨く』として位置づけられ、文化活動が非常に豊富です。学校紹介では、決断と行動、愛と信頼を重視する姿勢が示されています。","clubs":[{"id":9894,"name":"陸 上","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.akenohoshi-cyukou.ed.jp/schoollife/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":9895,"name":"バレーボール","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.akenohoshi-cyukou.ed.jp/schoollife/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":9896,"name":"バドミントン","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.akenohoshi-cyukou.ed.jp/schoollife/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":9897,"name":"バスケットボール","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.akenohoshi-cyukou.ed.jp/schoollife/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":9898,"name":"ソフトボール","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.akenohoshi-cyukou.ed.jp/schoollife/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":9899,"name":"弓 道","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.akenohoshi-cyukou.ed.jp/schoollife/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":9900,"name":"英 語","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.akenohoshi-cyukou.ed.jp/schoollife/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":9901,"name":"書 道","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.akenohoshi-cyukou.ed.jp/schoollife/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":9902,"name":"華 道","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.akenohoshi-cyukou.ed.jp/schoollife/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":9903,"name":"ギターマンドリン","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.akenohoshi-cyukou.ed.jp/schoollife/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":9904,"name":"コーロ・ステルラ","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.akenohoshi-cyukou.ed.jp/schoollife/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":9905,"name":"美 術","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.akenohoshi-cyukou.ed.jp/schoollife/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":9906,"n